     3	A trusted external supervisor provisions this broker over an anonymous socket
     4	and launches the CLI with only the attached descriptor. The model-capable CLI
     5	rejects private signing keys in its environment and immediately makes the
     6	descriptor non-inheritable, so model/reviewer subprocesses receive neither
     7	private signing material nor an IPC capability.
     8	"""
